>_ TOKENHOLIC   [HOME] BOARDS  MODELS  SOURCES  SETTINGS                  scanned 4m ago

╭─ KEYS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ 1–5     switch view                                                                  │
│ tab     next view; shift+tab goes back                                               │
│ p       change period                                                                │
│ j / k   move the selection or scroll                                                 │
│ d       show exact token categories on HOME                                          │
│ r       scan local usage again                                                       │
│ ?       close help                                                                   │
│ q       quit                                                                         │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ READING THE NUMBERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ $ EST   what the tokens would cost at API list prices. It is an estimate, not what   │
│         you paid.                                                                    │
│ ≥1.2M   a lower bound: part of the usage was not reported or has no price.           │
│ —       not available. It never means zero.                                          │
│ PRICED  the share of tokens the estimate covers.                                     │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
1–5 views · p period · d detail · j/k scroll · r refresh · ? help · q quit
